{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family is gathered for a cozy celebration, but everyone looks miserable! What happened here? Who are these people (and pets)?! And why are they so unhappy?!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/05e36b269572ca0ade37f21fe7102040.avif?t=1766008032\" width=1560 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the family dog to the grumpy grandma, peek inside their unfortunate lives and investigate the events leading up to the party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/0bfc81e7a23a1af4894d96b445bc6163.poster.avif?t=1766008032\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/0bfc81e7a23a1af4894d96b445bc6163.webm?t=1766008032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/0bfc81e7a23a1af4894d96b445bc6163.mp4?t=1766008032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/66dd06e87f12dd156c145505ad7988b5.avif?t=1766008032\" width=1560 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour each hand-drawn scene for clues that point to identities, motives, and misadventures. <i>Don't let the cuteness fool you!</i> You'll need to read carefully, snoop thoroughly, and get ready to <strong>put your deduction skills to the test!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/e91cf55f3ffbe724c65b33c43d076be1.poster.avif?t=1766008032\" width=1050 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/e91cf55f3ffbe724c65b33c43d076be1.webm?t=1766008032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/e91cf55f3ffbe724c65b33c43d076be1.mp4?t=1766008032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/extras/15a749e8fd40d8a1d2cfa4ec410c3be5.avif?t=1766008032\" width=1560 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own conclusions across <strong>10 challenging cases</strong> full of mishaps, betrayal, and mayhem! Do you have what it takes to solve the Case of the Worst Day Ever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Increasing Difficulty</i></strong> - from easy-peasy to truly brain-teasing, get ready to hone your detective skills\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hint System</strong></i>\u00a0- feeling stuck? use the in-game hint system to get back on track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Fill-in-the-Blank Conclusions</strong></i>\u00a0- use the words collected throughout each case to form your own conclusions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In-Game Notepad</strong></i>\u00a0- keep track of important clues with the in-game notepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lighthearted Cases\u00a0</i></strong>-  enjoy humorous, slice-of-life mysteries without dark themes</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Very Stinky Situation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/c5760906815270c6e4b43f4b839ca6f42190e91c.jpg"},{"name":"The Multi-Tool Mix-Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/fb727e8f99c3d4818cb6bc80d584d1fd0898bb37.jpg"},{"name":"Maintenance Mayhem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/52ba94c36685c720e148c14d2de64b791b36400a.jpg"},{"name":"Makeup Mavens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/1c7b56e3dfae15cbce8fb8e358e746a21ca56c67.jpg"},{"name":"A Bake Off Gone Wild","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/6de74dceda72e07548af0f343b17b140d2aee2c7.jpg"},{"name":"Middle School Melodrama","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/cca074651976ecf3aabb226f5bd31abed8a0f0e1.jpg"},{"name":"Puppy's Day Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/074b6cb1e54994c8862d53f93d0de99fe9d6f2e8.jpg"},{"name":"The Office Inquisition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/f458134ceaffda24d32fc0006d04895bf618fc77.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Bingo Brawl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/4df690b72f6c7aecfcceabd3d915c957d482e348.jpg"},{"name":"A Graduation to Remember","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279410/536730f058ca359345187106ec899bd22fe4f96f.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279410?t=1766008032","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766008032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/